OL,5,G0300 BBC News
OL,6,     FThe latest five minute news
OL,7,     Fbulletin from BBC World Service.
OL,8,G0306 Outlook
OL,9,     FWhen Dutch writer Raoul de Jong
OL,10,     Ffirst met his dad, he warned him
OL,11,     Fabout a family curse: an ancestor
OL,12,     Fwho could turn himself into a
OL,13,     Fjaguar. Raoul went to Suriname to
OL,14,     Ftrack him down.
OL,15,G0350 Witness History
OL,16,     FIn 1946, Mexican American Raoul
OL,17,     FCortez launched the first US radio
OL,18,     Fservice in Spanish. Based in San
OL,19,     FAntonio, Texas, he used charm and
OL,20,     Fcreativity to win over
OL,21,     Fadvertisers.
